k8s

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Cache
.npm
.eslintcache
*.tsbuildinfo

# Documentation (not needed for runtime)
*.md
!README.md

# Test files
coverage
.nyc_output
__tests__
*.test.ts
*.spec.ts
